{"id":"2026-10.0001","at":"2026-10-02T19:06:00-07:00","who":"apartment","type":"note","data":{"text":"The front door was opened onto a steel fire escape on the east face: two flights down, one up to the deck, a ladder to the roof next door."},"by":"owner"}
